        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "半决赛，五比七、二比六负于萨巴伦卡。今年大满贯最好成绩是4强，分别在澳网和美网。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3493ffb67e62cd9d64eabb94ea0ef678d7439d7bd93a3c17c512d0bb645fe631",
